# Backend

- SQL migrations in `backend/supabase/migrations/` with explicit RLS
- Indexer: pure parsers + thin DB IO; Vitest with fixture dirs first
- Edge Functions: Deno, deno test, no `any`
- Signed download URLs via HMAC; never expose raw volume over HTTP
- Catalog soft-delete via `deleted_at`
